WEBVTT

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
anata ni tazuneraretara watashi

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
あなたに尋ねられたら私

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
When you come visit me

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
nikkori hohoemu deshou

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
にっこり微笑むでしょう

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
I'll probably break into a big smile

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
umaku ienai kedo subete ga

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
うまく言えないけどすべてが

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
I can't really put it into words

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
totemo totemo kageyaitemasu

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
とてもとても輝いてます

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
but everything is shining oh so bright

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
kitto ima goro minna atsumattemasu

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
きっと今頃皆集まってます

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
I bet everyone is together right about now

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
sore wa sawagashikute

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
それは騒がしくて

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
It may get a little rowdy

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
demo itoshii

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
でもいとしい

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
but I wouldn't have it any other way

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
tonde ikimasu itsumo no tokoro e

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
飛んでいきますいつもの所へ

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
Let's fly away to our usual place

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
taiyou takaku ashita mo hare desu

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
太陽高く明日も晴れです

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
Tomorrow will be clear with the sun in the sky

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
moshi mo sukoshi sabishiku nattemo

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
もしも少し寂しくなっても

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
Even if you get a little lonely

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
daijoubu chanto miteimasu

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
大丈夫ちゃんと見ています

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
it's okay, I'll be watching

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
koko de

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
ここで

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
right here

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:42.710
It's fall...

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.070
Oh?

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:50.590
Excuse me, Mr. Dragonfly, but that's not a place for you to rest your wings.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.510
Oh, why not?

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:03.310
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:03.310
<b>Return of the Maid</b>

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.520
Ryuga, are you writing another report?

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.440
Yeah. Although it's more like a written apology.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:17.650
Here.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:18.790
Thanks, Sera.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:24.540
It can't be helped. You went and fought Mahoro against Matthew's wishes.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.840
My orders were to thoroughly investigate Mahoro and her surroundings.

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:33.770
Those orders that allowed the personal conflict were contradictory in the first place.

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:35.820
Contradictory?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:41.290
The more I investigated Mahoro, the more difficult I found it to fight her.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:45.540
Yes... After I got a taste of human life.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.080
Oh, he's here!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:54.650
Good morning!

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.140
Good morning!

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:04.780
What's that bastard up to, still disguising himself as a teacher...

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.260
And Mahoro is far too trusting...

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.940
Huh? Will Ryuga being a teacher cause some sort of trouble?

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.990
And Suguru was just as big a sucker as she is...

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:22.130
Mahoro says it's okay, so why not?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.880
At least my getting hit by him wasn't a total waste.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:29.300
Well. I guess their kindhearted spirits are their good point.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.060
That is precisely why I, Slash, have to teach that idiot Saint android...

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.090
...a little something called "where to draw the line."

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.330
She's so beautiful...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.490
She's our eternal idol!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.130
It must've been tough to get your hands on an autographed photo book, Suguru.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.030
Yeah!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:04:00.790
After six months of negotiations, I got it in exchange for 30 Misato House meal tickets.

