00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:06.860
What are you kids doing?

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.310
<b>Riho Asaoka</b>

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.310
<b>Beautiful Doll</b>

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:08.820
Let's see.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.130
Mr. Ryuga!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.280
What're you doing here?

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.500
W-What is this? You boys!

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.880
Dirty thoughts are inappropriate! Confiscated!

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.600
My beloved Riho Asaoka!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:24.870
My treasure!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.280
<b>STAFF ROOM</b>

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.150
That said...

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.070
How beautiful...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.810
Her features should be thought of as a god-given masterpiece.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.890
The photos are artistic, as well.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.510
Perhaps I ought to return it.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.920
Goodness. Mr. Ryuga, what are you doing with that?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.920
Oh, this? I confiscated it from Mr. Misato a few minutes ago.

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:46.650
What?!

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:52.040
My, Mr. Misato, you're such a child.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:52.560
Pardon?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.340
You don't have to buy this stuff!

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:01.090
I'll show you the real thing whenever you want!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.240
Oh, dear. Again, Ms. Shikijo?

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:09.200
It's like she's from another planet. She's incomprehensible.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:16.190
What a pervert, grabbing a dirty book from Suguru and then drooling over it himself.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.400
Dirty thoughts are inappropriate!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.640
I think I'm going to have to destroy him, after all.

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:29.040
Mr. Ryuga, goodbye!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:30.350
See you tomorrow.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:31.760
Bye!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:32.780
Take care.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.620
Bye-bye, teacher.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:35.730
Hurry home, now.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.600
Take us out to lunch sometime!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.260
Ask again in 10 years.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.210
Cheapskate!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:50.900
I'm dealing with Ryuga here, so he probably knew I was following him ages ago.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.220
Well, I realize it's against the rules a little, but maybe I'll take him on right here.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.600
Ooh, it's Slashie!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.430
W-Who just called me by some weird baby name?!

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:14.240
Harune?

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.160
Slash!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.810
Is there an enemy around?

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:27.650
N-No.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.400
Mahoro?

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.670
Listen, listen!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.360
Slashie's feet are all dirty, so I thought I'd clean him up!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.810
And then, and then...

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:39.630
Well, we haven't got many customers yet, so I guess it's okay.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.970
Yay!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.030
But just this once, got it?

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.480
What are you doing, then?

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.490
I-I was just taking a walk, understand?!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.930
In that case, let's all get him clean together!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:52.810
Good idea!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:53.880
Okay, then...

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.840
Wha...?! What did you say?!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.760
W-What the heck am I doing?

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:06.980
We'll run to the open skies, we won't stop!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.580
Even if we gasp for breath, we won't stop!

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.860
Public baths are so relaxing...

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:12.710
Because nobody's words...

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.800
...can reach us now...

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:19.750
...we'll run until we've had our fill.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:24.970
Damn it, I think I'm coming down with a cold from that bath.

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:28.630
If we fight here, we won't cause trouble for anyone.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.660
Maybe it's about time I show myself.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:35.130
Well, it's about time for me to get back to the ship...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.810
But you want to see me about something. Right, Mr. Support Mech?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:40.980
Yeah.

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.500
You know what this is about, right?

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:48.740
I've begun to think that I'd like to live as a human, too.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.110
If that's true, do it someplace else.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:54.870
I'm Mahoro's guardian beast.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:59.530
I ain't gonna let some stinking Saint hang around anywhere near her.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:02.170
No?

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:03.430
No.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:09.850
I'll kill you!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.090
I have to be careful around this one.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:31.200
Cross-chop!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:32.530
<b>ARRRRGH!</b>

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:37.830
<b>ARRRRGH!</b>

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:35.170
I came looking for you because you were late, and what do I find?

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.780
You should know better than to fight!

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.270
If you don't get along, I'll get angry!

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:43.000
Mahoro, did something happen?!

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:47.500
Ha! You expect me to get along with a rotten Saint android?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:52.050
Who knows how many times I've been stripped by this bastard?!

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.570
Ha! That's my line!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.350
Who knows how many times I've been bitten and raked...

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.350
...by those filthy fangs and claws of yours!

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:02.000
Oh, that's just dandy! You wanna take me on?!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.360
Fine by me!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.760
Cross...!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:14.750
Are you listening? The fact that you're grumpy is proof that your tummy is empty.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:18.040
You're the only one who gets bitchy when you're hungry.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.740
Hi-ya! Chop, chop, chop, chop!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.170
Chop, chop, chop, chop, chop, chop, chop, chop, chop!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.660
Forgive me!

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:23.250
Honest!

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:24.150
The fool.

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:28.440
Have a rice ball or something for now and calm down.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.940
And then, listen to me.

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.360
Leader must have told you this once.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:40.930
"Earth people and Saint will one day walk hand in hand towards a single dream."

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:44.840
"We of Vesper exist to make that ideal come to pass."

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.400
"Only love and courage are friends."

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.610
No, that's not it. "To create the world to come."

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:58.990
<b>Blah        Blah        Blah        Blah        Blah       Blah        Blah        Blah        Blah        Blah       Blah        Blah        Blah     Blah     Blah    Blah     Blah     Blah     Blah     Blah</b>

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:53.510
She gets her longwindedness from Leader.

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:54.940
What a hopeless girl.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.990
Yes... She's violent, yet preachy. What a difficult girl.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.400
T-This is my treasure!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:07.490
Oh, you can take that book home. I thought it was beautiful and artistic.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.270
C-Can I really? T-Thanks!

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.980
I don't think you should be looking at it at school, though.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:13.580
Yes, sir...

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:15.040
It's still a porno...

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:21.850
Suguru? What's that you're holding?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:26.770
Oh, this? This is, uh... a textbook.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.210
Oh! It's a dirty book!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.090
Dirty thoughts are bad!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.420
Come on, I'm confiscating it.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:44.780
Huh? H-Hey, Suguru! Hold it right there!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.210
Oh, my... We're saved.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:48.290
Forgive me, Suguru Misato.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:59.850
It's not like I care, but what made you decide that you wanted to live as a human?

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:03.390
Well, I guess it was back then...

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:14.240
I want to know what true strength really is.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.320
Heh. "True strength" huh?

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.250
Let's get one thing straight. I can't stand you.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.640
I can't stand you, but unfortunately, my master's word is law.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.910
I guess I can turn a blind eye to you loitering around here, Ryuga.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:40.590
Matthew, I think I'm finally beginning to understand...

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.620
...why you give souls to us androids.

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:50.240
That is why I believe more and more that I'd like to live as a human.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:53.970
Must... confiscate...

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.540
No!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.500
Ryuga's late!

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.690
Hey, Suguru! Kawahara!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:11.650
Let's grab something to eat on the way home, okay?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:12.590
Sure!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:16.450
Oh, I'm sorry. I have plans after school today.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:18.510
Plans? With who?

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.170
With Mahoro.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.720
What?! Don't tell me you're going on a date!

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.160
Is it?!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:27.090
No, I'm just tagging along while she's shopping.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.130
You know, at the mall in front of the train station.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.980
It's the same thing!

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:32.670
Why do you get all the luck?!

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:32.580
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.740
What are you talking about? Give it a rest, already.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:36.540
See ya, Suguru!

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.420
Yeah, later!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.880
Lucky bastard... I'm so jealous.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:46.250
Once we're grown up, we've gotta get our own maids!

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.700
I'll pass.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:55.430
Who was that?

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.900
U-Um...

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.650
W-Who is she?! Is she a stalker?!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:36.230
I suppose I arrived a bit early.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:41.340
But thanks to that, I got a delicious taste of autumn, so I'll leave it at that.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.730
Oh, no! This isn't good!

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.240
Mahoro!

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:55.000
I'm sorry, did I keep you waiting long?

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.330
No, it was delicious...

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:00.260
I mean, I haven't been waiting long at all.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.270
By the way, who is that behind you?

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:12.730
Oh, dear! Are you all right?

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.130
Is she a friend of yours?

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.660
No, I've never seen her before.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:27.110
She followed me all the way here, so I thought that maybe she knew you.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.960
Good afternoon. Did you want to see me about something?

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:35.260
Well, I... Um...

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:35.880
Yes?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:42.330
I want you to let me stay here.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.340
Huh?

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.340
Huh?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.320
Where do you mean, "here"?

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:49.150
No, that's not right.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:52.190
I wasn't supposed to meet you here.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:56.660
Not here, but where you live. Not here, but...

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.690
You can just take your time and tell us slowly.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:02.730
What's going on here?!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.750
Why did a Vesper android warrior show up in a place like this?!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.380
I don't have much choice... I'll have to dispose of 370 here.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:14.630
The same building as Mahoro.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.310
House? Yes, in your house...

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:26.600
Damn.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.680
Mahoro! It isn't aliens again, is it?!

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:34.190
This is a little too impolite for Saint.

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:37.070
I'm sorry, but please take this for me.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:43.610
It may be a bit dangerous to stay with us, so please go home without me, Suguru.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:44.960
Mahoro!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:50.430
They're only after this girl, so I'll be fine.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:51.280
Um...

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.380
I'm sorry, we'll talk later.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.870
Why are you helping me?

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:15.270
You came to see either Suguru or me, didn't you?

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:16.240
Yeah.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:21.410
If that's the case, that means you may be an important guest.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:27.700
Excuse me, but aren't you with Management?

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:32.310
Yeah. Um, yes. But not anymore.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.290
I don't want to go back there ever again.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.730
Come on. It looks like things are going to get hectic again.

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:41.680
Wait.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.880
I'll fight, too.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:04.690
Now!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:39.570
Hey, now... Wasn't 370 supposed to be our only target?

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:45.780
If you're letting an android egg you on, there's still room for improvement in your AI.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.630
Oh, well. I can't blame you.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.930
Just keep moving like you did just now, and you'll be fine.

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:55.440
For now, though, let's get clear of here.

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:43.790
It's me.

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:47.350
Oh, is this Professor Mephlis? Hello, this is Feldrance.

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.410
Oh, is that you, 227? I've been waiting for you!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.380
Is this a good time?

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.530
I just said that I've been waiting for you, didn't I?!

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.780
So, how'd it go?

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:01.200
Well, the operation to capture 370 seems to have failed.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:04.360
"Seems to" doesn't tell me anything! Be specific!

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:05.930
Oh. Yes, sir.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:10.810
V-1046R MAHORO showed up earlier than expected,

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.670
and the Man-Eaters you sent to capture her were wiped out.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:17.310
That's what happened, so I guess it's for certain.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.150
In other words...

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.110
In other words, you're saying that my plan went off without a hitch.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:26.410
Give me the details when you return.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:27.350
Bye.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:28.450
Yes, sir!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.400
I see! She destroyed three of those machines he's so proud of.

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:38.500
I can just picture the look on Canan's face tomorrow.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.560
It serves him right!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.210
She doesn't have any visible wounds.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:03.050
Which means there must be something wrong with her in general.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:26.970
Mahoro!

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:31.170
I broke my shoes.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:21:01.690
P-Please let me stay here in this house...

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:30.510
<b>Mahoro stops functioning in...</b>

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:30.510
